---
interface Props {
  routine: 'foundation' | 'daily' | 'high' | 'soft' | 'ear' | 'english' | 'song';
}
const { routine } = Astro.props;
const usesPitchControls = routine !== 'song';
const titles = {
  foundation: '基础发声专项',
  daily: '日常热身 / 基本功专项',
  high: '头声 / 换区 / 混声专项',
  soft: '弱唱 / 动态专项',
  ear: '音准 / 听唱专项',
  english: '英文节奏专项',
  song: '歌曲落地专项',
};
---

<guided-vocal-trainer data-routine={routine}>
  <section class="exercise-deck" aria-labelledby={`exercise-deck-${routine}`}>
    <div class="exercise-deck__heading">
      <span>专项短跟练</span>
      <h2 id={`exercise-deck-${routine}`}>{titles[routine]}</h2>
      <p>每条练习约 1–2 分钟。点一条后连续做完；条与条之间由你决定什么时候开始。每条自己留好准备、移调和结束休息，不会突然冲进下一项。</p>
    </div>

    {usesPitchControls && <div class="exercise-deck__controls">
      <label>
        <span>舒适起音</span>
        <select data-root>
          <option value="45">A2</option>
          <option value="46">B♭2</option>
          <option value="47">B2</option>
          <option value="48" selected>C3</option>
          <option value="50">D3</option>
          <option value="52">E3</option>
          <option value="53">F3</option>
          <option value="55">G3</option>
          <option value="57">A3</option>
          <option value="59">B3</option>
          <option value="60">C4</option>
          <option value="62">D4</option>
          <option value="64">E4</option>
          <option value="65">F4</option>
        </select>
        <small>只决定从哪里开始，不要求把列表唱满。</small>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>当天上限</span>
        <select data-ceiling>
          <option value="60">C4</option>
          <option value="62">D4</option>
          <option value="64" selected>E4</option>
          <option value="65">F4</option>
          <option value="67">G4</option>
          <option value="69">A4</option>
        </select>
        <small>用于限制自动移调。上限不是今天必须唱到的目标。</small>
      </label>
    </div>}

    <div class="exercise-deck__list" data-exercise-list></div>

    <div class="exercise-player" data-player hidden>
      <div class="exercise-player__top">
        <span data-phase>准备</span>
        <strong data-title>—</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="exercise-player__instruction" data-instruction>—</div>
      <div class="exercise-player__pattern" data-pattern>—</div>
      <div class="exercise-player__clock" data-clock>—</div>
      <progress data-progress max="100" value="0">0%</progress>
      <button type="button" data-stop>停止这条</button>
    </div>

    <div class="exercise-finish" data-finish hidden>
      <strong data-finish-title>这条完成</strong>
      <p data-finish-text>先缓一下。下一条不会自动开始。</p>
      <div>
        <button type="button" data-repeat>再来一遍</button>
        <button type="button" data-next>下一条</button>
        <button type="button" data-done>今天先到这</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="exercise-deck__note" data-note>
      单条练习内部不需要点屏幕。任何疼痛、刺激、沙哑或说话费力都直接停止。
    </p>
  </section>
</guided-vocal-trainer>

<script>
  const NOTE_NAMES = ['C', 'C♯/D♭', 'D', 'D♯/E♭', 'E', 'F', 'F♯/G♭', 'G', 'G♯/A♭', 'A', 'A♯/B♭', 'B'];

  const EXERCISES = {
    foundation: [
